The revision-4 code and focused assertions are now in place. The rotation test rotates and moves each enemy root before calling `Tick`, so it would fail if the controller only selected animation states and did not restore the Visual’s world rotation. I also confirmed no test outside NSC-077’s exclusive test fixtures asserts the old enemy scale or rotation.
